# Gaussian CGS units: the ESU electrical units with the EMU magnetic units, per J. D. Jackson, Classical
# Electrodynamics, 3rd ed., appendix on units, and NIST SP 811 (2008), appendix B.8 (F7: no new dimensions).
# Format: symbol:name formula [Type]; '#' starts a comment.

@system Gaussian
@extends cgs-esu.units
@include cgs-emu.units
@include si.units
@member G Mx Oe Gb

Fr:franklin statC [ElectricCharge]

@preferred ElectricCharge Fr
@preferred MagneticFluxDensity G
@preferred MagneticFlux Mx
